        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 13:51:25 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://perch-notch.netlify.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<b>Perch for Mac</b>

<li><b>Money tab</b> (optional): your Karo Budget data on the Mac. Safe to spend today, budget against actual with plans you can edit, and add, edit or delete transactions. Works on the Mac alone; with iCloud on it stays in step with Karo Budget on iPhone.</li>
<li><b>Runs tab</b> (optional): what you record with just for run. Weekly chart, totals and streaks, filtered by activity (Running, Cycling…), and a big map window for any run with the route coloured by pace, splits, elevation and a share link.</li>
<li><b>Beside the closed notch</b> (optional): money left today and your run streak.</li>
<li><b>⌘K palette:</b> "spent 250 coffee #food" logs an expense.</li>
<li><b>Claude:</b> new tools to log expenses, read spending and budgets, and summarise runs by activity.</li>
<li><b>Sync status</b> for Money and Runs, with Sync now in the tab headers and Settings.</li>
<li><b>Goals are gone.</b> Weekly review stays.</li>

<b>Perch for iPhone</b> — Today, Upcoming and Notes; Goals removed.

]]></description>
